Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sails all unfurled!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready now for adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're itching to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to roam!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So all aboard now we're set to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail to the ocean so deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for a truly grand adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think\Nthat sounds really fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All this excitement is second to none!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that\NI just won't ever forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the way that I felt\Nwhen our journey was set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I won't be scared as long\Nas I keep that feeling there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.26,0:01:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, let us keep up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.46,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,While enjoying every\Ntrip from place to place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our timid hearts get the rhythm ingrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's keep going, adventure awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in\Nhand, everybody rejoices!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Party on, cause we stand tall and proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous, be\Naware it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.88,0:02:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.26,0:02:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It ain't here, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, but what are we doing\Nback here all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a dream after all, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.10,0:02:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I really lost my shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.40,0:03:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This feels weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.62,0:03:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone came in here and stole\Nall our food while we were out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy with a mouthful of grub is\Ncomplaining that there's nothing to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm mad too, but at least they\Nleft the dried food behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I need meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.14,0:03:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I let this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I really let my guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They took our lunchboxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.76,0:03:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing but cheese. No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So where's Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she waiting outside or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.46,0:03:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You let some bastard kidnap my angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you chase them\Nto the ends of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.26,0:03:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not really our fault, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This particular guy is kind\Nof hard to catch, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell me who he is\Nand where I can find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hunt him down right\Nnow and bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:04:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, let me explain the situation\Nhere It's sort of complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so this is the deal you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it kills us we\Nhave two big things that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to get back no\Nmatter what food and Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and our shadows too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.38,0:04:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's three.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, uh, I'm not sure if one\Nof those really makes the list
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Food is great and all but let's\Nfocus on Nami and shadows for now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He... He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,TO MARRY HER!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No way in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.06,0:04:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this guy must be pretty\Nbrave if he wants to marry Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's all this\Nabout me being a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does my shadow get\Nto do all the cool stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Usopp, you guys already saw who or\Nwhat has Sanji and Luffy's shadows, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No one told me we were fighting one\Nof the seven warlords of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I just hide in a hole\Nand cry myself to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys were all business\Njust a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.88,0:04:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you put someone's shadow in a zombie\Nthey act like that person, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I think I've seen your zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:04:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:04:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of guy was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well he looked just
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,like you but since he was
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,wearing wooden clogs I\Ncould tell it wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.30,0:05:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So if we find this guy with\Nthe clogs the dog penguin thing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,one has Sanji's shadow and\NLuffy's giant monster zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.74,0:05:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All we gotta do is\Nthrow some salt in their
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.74,0:05:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,mouths and then we'll\Nget our shadows back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-huh, that's what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.44,0:05:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job on figuring out their weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you pull that one off?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.98,0:05:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your thanks for the afro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Skeleton that only did he\Nknow how to beat the zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He also told us you'd be\Nwaiting back here at the Sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What you ran into Brook again? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I feel a little bad\Nsince I asked a pretty cruel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,question even though you\Nwanted him to join the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When I met the guy I didn't\Ngive him a fair shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.16,0:05:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth be told I barely even\Nthought of him as human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But once I actually took\Nthe time to talk to him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,for a second I found out\Nhe has a real backbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.62,0:06:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Other than the obvious, I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.94,0:06:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,that skeleton's a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're still in a mood to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one more burning question\NI still need an answer to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go out in public looking like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.64,0:06:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how people are\Ngoing to react, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're a talking skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way someone as creepy as you\Nis ever going to make friends with anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,People are going to run away in terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, why are you telling him that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.26,0:06:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you could see the sun and\Nmake it out of these cursed waters,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,your life would still\Nbe full of suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You've had it rough for\Na long time already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you could handle that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.84,0:06:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you said before that you were\Nso lonely that you wanted to die, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:07:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I would have\Ngiven up on life a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.76,0:07:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, you still act like a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You laugh, you sing, you pretend like\Nyou don't have a care in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it that's keeping you alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you made a promise to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How could it be so important?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're interested in me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The story is quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,At a certain point in the past,\Nbefore we came to these waters,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,my crew left behind a good friend of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a troubling situation,\Nbut we did it out of necessity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The only consolation we\Ncould offer this friend was a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,promise that we would return\None day no matter the cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But then the crew was annihilated and the\Npromise that we made was left unfulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I am the only survivor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,it is my duty to return to our\Nfriend even if I must bear sad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How long has it been\Nsince the day we died?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:08:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost count but it's\Nbeen more than 50 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,50 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking ages ago. Here, hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't even born yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to break it to you, buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's no way your\Nfriend's still waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's true that he would have\Nevery right to leave by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I realize I may be foolish\Nto believe he's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if by some chance he\Ndid believe in our promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.02,0:08:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And is waiting for us even\Nafter all these years!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.98,0:08:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,then the loneliness he's suffering\Nwould be far worse than my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.28,0:08:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad he must be,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.94,0:08:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,wondering if we betrayed him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,wondering if our promise was alive, yet\Nstill waiting for us in the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.18,0:08:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of that friend that we left at\Nthe Cape swearing to meet again is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He was just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:09:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We simply couldn't take such a young\Nwhale on a dangerous journey like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.64,0:09:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.90,0:09:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine how\Nbig he's grown since then
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that whale\Nunderstood your promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In his own way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but think that he's\Nstill waiting for us at that cape?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.46,0:09:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,staring longingly at the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably wants to hear us play our\Ncheerful music again, dancing and singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.64,0:09:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, I suppose it's\Na bit late for that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I am able to return,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.44,0:09:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he'll forgive us for\Nrunning away and dying like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter how much he resents me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,For forcing him to suffer\Nall of these years,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,death is never an apology!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Because when a man makes a promise he\Ndoesn't stop fighting until he fulfills it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So there you have it\Nthat's it the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy. What are\Nthe chances I'll be damned?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.30,0:10:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We've met that whale before,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we know
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You know him. That's crazy.\NHow is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:11:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It was when we passed through to\Nthe Grand Line at the two capes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The damn giant whale was\Nblocking the entrance
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It was at the Red Line Grief drove him to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,keep bashing his head\Nagainst the dividing wall
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.76,0:11:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He spent 50 years waiting\Nfor his friends there
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,believing they'd return\Nfor him after their voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.30,0:11:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but somehow Luffy convinced\Nhim to stop trying
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,to break through the\Nwall like a damned idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even now, he's alive out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting at that cape for his\Nfriends to finally return.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an incredible story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about true friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.28,0:11:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He kept his promise to them\Nfor more than half a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think, we met one of Laboon's\Nfriends by complete coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:12:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder what that\Nskeleton's doing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't deny that you've gotten stronger\Nover these past five years, but so have I!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember, I already know\Nevery move you're gonna make!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You care more about that damn\Nafro than the skull beneath it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you, it's the biggest\Ntarget on your whole body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Laboon, I wonder, old friend, after all\Nthese years, do you still remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:13:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When I think of how alone you must\Nhave felt, it breaks my heart in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, I don't suppose\NI have a heart anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Couran line is so fearsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, I tried as hard as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to bring them back to you, but\Nall of our friends have passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only have I lost\Nour friends, I lost my.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,face my body my shadow\Neverything I once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If we were to meet again\Nyou probably wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,even recognize me how\Ncould you with me looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.02,0:14:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything left, not\Na single reminder of my own self.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Except for this hair on\Nmy head, black, round and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,funny just like you I\Ndidn't notice it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But they kind of look alike Brooks head\Nis almost the same shape as Laboon's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you could be brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.22,0:14:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I must protect it so\Nyou'll still recognize me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.42,0:14:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Waboo, just as I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.24,0:14:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're still waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have promised Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I love that bonehead in a stupid whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,SHUT UP!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.44,0:15:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so pumped, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a musician, a talking skeleton,\Nhas an afro, does that yo-ho-ho thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and he was one of Laboon's best friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.18,0:15:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I've gotta force him\Nto, he's gonna join our crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We got us a musician! Any objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Would it really change\Nyour mind even if we did?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.68,0:15:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I want him to join the crew too,\Nno question, him and Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Complete and total approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me here you big dumb bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not scared of skeletons, dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I can answer such an easy question!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to put a stop to this\Nshotgun wedding of Narmies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Saru, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.06,0:16:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Going off to get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep adding shadows?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a lot we need to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.48,0:16:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for the counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.22,0:16:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to put Thriller\NBark in a watery grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.53,0:16:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got our work cut out for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt we're just\Ngoing to turn the corner
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.62,0:16:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and find the zombies\Nwith our shadows in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that, Luffy Zombie\Nis a complete freak of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's six times bigger than any giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.94,0:16:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure anyone could beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.12,0:16:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.03,0:16:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we don't really have\Nto worry about the zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.96,0:16:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I kind of want\Nto see how cool mine is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.82,0:16:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.22,0:16:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to hide from the sun\Nfor the rest of your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get our shadows\Nback from these ghouls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.14,0:16:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but there's another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember what that\Ngeezer zombie told us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you fight those zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you have such\Nunbelievable strength. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So what did you want to tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:17:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an evil man who\Nmust be brought down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think you youngsters\Nare strong enough to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.46,0:17:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's left a trail of victims in his wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you defeat him, they'll all be rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All we've got to do to free the\Nshadows is put an end to Gecko Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He said that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.02,0:17:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, always gets straight to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Up there, Gecko Moria's just sitting\Non his big ass waiting for us? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.84,0:17:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.72,0:17:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,His butt's asking for a kicking,\Nso that's what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And then all the shadows will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, fire up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're rescuing Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I wanted to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That Invisible Man's gonna be the\NDivisible Man when I'm done with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick his ass into fractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.26,0:17:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot to tell you,\Nbut the Invisible Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he spied on Nami\Nwhile she was taking a bath
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to add\Nmore fuel to the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not seem angry enough to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.40,0:18:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like it's all my fault since I let
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that creep take Nami\Nright in front of my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only right that I go with Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And also I'll do anything to\Nstay away from that Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about the skeleton\Nfighting on his own he needs
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,backup if Straw Hat beats Moria\Nbefore the skeleton zombie wins?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then everything's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I got to work overtime to help\NBrooke and hold on to my own damn shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.06,0:18:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you some extra\Nbackup with that one Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I Want to see if this legendary\Nsamurai he's fighting lives up
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.76,0:18:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to his reputation or not if we're picking\Nnami's my top priority That's the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.02,0:18:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to lend my hands\Nto and once we get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We can all take down Moria as a team\NYou say it like it's no big deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.60,0:18:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but did you forget who he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.00,0:18:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of the seven warlords of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.22,0:18:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Crocodile was one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.24,0:19:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my point exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Crocodile got this close to killing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you to be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.97,0:19:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I already warned you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.14,0:19:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your zombie is terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.43,0:19:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got it, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.14,0:19:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I had enough to make one\Nsack for each of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A little concoction of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I call them zombie death salt balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so this is what you\Nwere whipping up earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good thinking, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.24,0:19:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're gonna do this thing, there's\None point I cannot stress enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.00,0:19:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be a lot of thick\Nforests on this island to hide in,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.78,0:19:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's no guarantee we can\Navoid the sunlight at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.60,0:19:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all only alive right now\Nbecause it's the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, sunrise\Nis our literal deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get your shadows back by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.32,0:19:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's imperative that\Nwe're out of here by dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.58,0:19:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing worse than going\Na whole night on an empty stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to make you regret you\Neven thought about taking our food.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me, Maria?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.28,0:20:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make him give back twice\Nthe amount he took from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And before dawn! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.20,0:20:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.40,0:20:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you not listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.62,0:20:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was saying we got to get your\Nshadows back by sunrise or otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, screw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one big ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.84,0:20:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd think it'd have a\Nbetter view of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.72,0:20:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But who needs a view when\Nlife looks this good?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.90,0:20:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll use this ship to\Nbecome king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What Zora's gotten himself into now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's climbed to the top of\Nthe mast for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.44,0:20:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.62,0:20:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on master. Just hear us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.48,0:20:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It just doesn't seem like a good\Nidea to us to work with such an
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.62,0:21:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,uncontrollable monster I mean the\Nguy is capable of destroying islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's bad news, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I just know it'll calm down. He just\Nneeds to be properly broken in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.12,0:21:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be obedient before you know it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.86,0:21:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.77,0:21:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,it's all in order with all\Nthat my command we can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,stopped and we'll continue to\Ngather even more powerful shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.62,0:21:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you know it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,our undead army will be stocked\Nfull of unstoppable special zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.46,0:21:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need a mountain of those\Nmarionettes for what we have in store.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hogback.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Hogback! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates, the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter Hilda those\Nthree pirates whose shadows we just
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.76,0:21:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,claimed they woke up somehow and now\Nthey're coming back here with all
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.10,0:22:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,their friends what impossible no\None wakes up that quickly after the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,shadow's taken i i didn't see it\Nmyself but their friends seem to have
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.84,0:22:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,beaten them awake anyway it also\Nseems that they're in cahoots with
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.08,0:22:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the humming swordsman that's\Nprobably where they're getting their
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.72,0:22:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,information from the one thing i\Ndo know for certain is that he He
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.32,0:22:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,explained to the pirates how to purify\Nthe zombies and release their shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.32,0:22:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.78,0:22:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All the zombies are\Nterrified for their lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.44,0:22:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates have got them on the run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.50,0:22:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The wild zombies, surprise\Nzombies, the zombie soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.42,0:22:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,None of them stand a chance\Nagainst these maniacs,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.48,0:22:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,even if they didn't have salt with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.12,0:22:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only option is to\Ncall the zombie generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.84,0:22:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But if they manage to purify\Nthem, then the pirates might win!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.56,0:22:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We need Absalom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.32,0:22:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, um, I'm pretty sure\Nhis wedding ceremony just began.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.12,0:22:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm also pretty sure that all of\Nthe zombie generals are attending.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.80,0:23:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean all those idiots\Nare gathered in one place?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.34,0:23:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot to ask\Nyou something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.92,0:23:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Absalom wanted to know if he could use\Nyour dance hall for his wedding reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.60,0:23:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.51,0:23:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose a wedding is a special\Nbeautiful event But tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,do you think this is a\Ngood time for nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.00,0:23:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how, but I\Nwant that ceremony stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.24,0:23:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just I'm one of his zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.38,0:23:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's completely impossible for\Nme to go against anything he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.68,0:23:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the stupid animal\Nhave his wedding. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.36,0:23:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I weaken the pirates with my ghosts,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.42,0:23:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the zombie soldiers can scoop them up\Nand carry them here like tossil kittens.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.78,0:23:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because they figured out the zombies'\Nweakness doesn't mean we need to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.88,0:23:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll gather up their entire crew\Nand have them here lickety-split.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.94,0:23:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and get some\Nmarionettes ready for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.90,0:23:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the pirates that still have their shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.48,0:23:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be in my room if\Nyou need anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.08,0:24:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.26,0:24:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.76,0:24:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.67,0:24:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She's quite useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.98,0:24:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What would we begin to do without her?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.72,0:24:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, if you wanted to be useful,\Nyou could shut your fat mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.54,0:24:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Kumasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.84,0:24:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, everything seems to be in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.96,0:24:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No reason to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.26,0:24:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.32,0:24:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.08,0:24:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're just gonna sit there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.90,0:24:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it any wonder why\Nyou're always so bored?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.28,0:24:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not bored\Nenough to bother standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.06,0:24:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just wait here for Oz to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.80,0:24:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, may I ask a simple request?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.98,0:24:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.98,0:24:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If it doesn't make any difference to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.56,0:24:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,could I be second in command\Nover Absalom zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.52,0:24:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Moria!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.58,0:24:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you? No, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.54,0:24:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.50,0:25:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give us back our fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.76,0:25:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one of you is the sick bastard\Nthat spied on Nami in the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.64,0:25:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me, I swear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.98,0:25:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.78,0:25:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, we might not even\Nneed the salt after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.94,0:25:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Their anger's doing the job just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.14,0:25:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think they even\Nremember about the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.44,0:25:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Five of the pirates are\Nstorming toward the dance hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.32,0:25:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that, but there's two\Nmore of them on the bridge below.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.70,0:25:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.38,0:25:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe these slow stupid\Npieces of crap managed to capture me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.20,0:25:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The more I think about it,\Nthe more it pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.34,0:25:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you developed a pretty\Nclose bond to me after I saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.32,0:25:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to call me bro if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.02,0:25:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather get caught again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.80,0:25:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, not good? What is it? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.32,0:25:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even deserve to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.94,0:25:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I was a mosquito.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.90,0:25:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.08,0:25:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My soul is as twisted\Nas my curly eyebrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.22,0:26:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, Sanji, why are you\Njust lying there? What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.22,0:26:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.44,0:26:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Those ghosts suck the will out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.58,0:26:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,One touch from them and\Nthey break your spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.82,0:26:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that much, but I\Ndon't know how to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.26,0:26:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Call, we betcha now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.74,0:26:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it. Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.90,0:26:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Blitzstar!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.12,0:26:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.34,0:26:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never get off this\Nship if they catch us, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.14,0:26:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghosts are catching up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.74,0:26:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're right behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.86,0:26:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.00,0:26:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are taking up enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.84,0:26:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.10,0:26:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.62,0:26:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.80,0:27:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.84,0:27:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.20,0:27:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.74,0:27:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.18,0:27:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That really freaked me out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.08,0:27:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The stairs are completely wiped out. Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.80,0:27:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the rest of the building?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.92,0:27:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Something came crashing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.86,0:27:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, Sanji, those zombies, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.16,0:27:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They all fell down with the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.66,0:27:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Their legs are twitching,\Nso I'm sure they're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.10,0:27:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.72,0:27:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm curious about is this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.04,0:27:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever it is,\Nit's blocking our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.34,0:27:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure is a weird-looking wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.50,0:27:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.60,0:27:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.02,0:27:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.62,0:28:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not made of rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.40,0:28:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons left!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.78,0:28:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.69,0:28:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't even put a dent in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.32,0:28:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.23,0:28:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.58,0:28:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.16,0:28:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A big, pink, fleshy wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.52,0:28:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a wall, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.76,0:28:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's loopy soppy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.82,0:28:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
